WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:08.570
Everything about a tenant on one page: lease, documents, legal details, store contacts and what is missing.

2
00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:14.170
Tenant files keep everything about each brand that has signed with The Wave.

3
00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:22.260
How many are trading, who opens soon, how complete the files are, documents to renew and rent in arrears.

4
00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:29.180
See them as cards, as a table, or as a compliance matrix of every required document.

5
00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:33.600
Open a tenant. Atelier Nour is still signing.

6
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:39.780
The header shows the legal name, units, status and how complete the file is.

7
00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:46.100
Jump to any part of the file from this bar.

8
00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:53.400
Compliance lists the required documents. Missing ones are marked, so you know exactly what to ask for.

9
00:00:57.410 --> 00:01:04.570
Legal details, the store team and contacts sit on the right. Edit them as they change.

10
00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:11.100
Portal access invites the tenant to their own portal, to pay invoices and send requests.

11
00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:16.120
Fact sheet prints a one-page summary of the tenant for meetings.
